{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify Liquid “How It Works” section.
    
    Goal:
    Black-and-white Apple-like 4-step horizontal slider.
    
    Rules:
    - 4 editable cards.
    - All cards must have the same size.
    - All image areas must have the same size.
    - Each card must use a 1:1 square image area.
    - Images must never change card height.
    - Images must not overflow.
    - Use object-fit: cover.
    
    Each card:
    - Step number
    - Title
    - Text
    - Desktop image upload
    - Mobile image upload
    
    Layout:
    - Desktop: horizontal slider.
    - Mobile: horizontal swipe slider.
    - Use scroll snap.
    - Add pagination dots.
    - Hide scrollbar.
    
    Shopify:
    - Liquid section.
    - Complete schema.
    - Max 4 blocks.
    - No external libraries.
    - Class prefix: ttn-hiw-
    
    Output only full Liquid code., Follow-up improvements:
    
    - Add a body copy below the "How it works" heading. It should be editable from the Shopify editor.
    - Remove all borders from the cards.
    - Use soft corner radii throughout the section. A border radius of 16px is preferred.
    - Keep the design minimal and Apple-inspired.
    - Cards should rely on spacing and subtle shadows instead of borders.
    - Maintain equal card sizes and equal 1:1 image areas across all slides.
    - Preserve the existing slider behavior and pagination dots., Improve the step number design.
    
    - Instead of plain text numbers, place the step number inside a small rounded pill/circle.
    - Center it horizontally inside the card.
    - Position it near the top with generous spacing.
    - Use a subtle light gray background.
    - Use bold black text.
    - Keep it minimal and Apple-inspired.
    - Border radius should be fully rounded.
    - The number badge should feel elegant and premium, similar to Apple's UI elements., Keep the original card layout.
    
    The previous layout was better.
    
    - Place the title and description at the top of the card.
    - Keep the image in the bottom section of the card.
    - The image should occupy the lower half of the card.
    - Maintain generous spacing between text and image.
    - Do not place the image above the title.
    - Keep all cards identical.
    - Maintain the 1:1 image area.
    - Preserve the Apple-inspired premium look.
    
    For the step number:
    - Use a small rounded pill with soft gray background.
    - Center it horizontally near the top of the card.
    - Make it subtle and elegant., The step number badge, title, description and image must belong to the same card.
    
    Currently the image feels like a separate section below the text.
    
    Please make each slide a single card containing:
    
    - Step number badge at the top
    - Title below the badge
    - Description below the title
    - 1:1 image area at the bottom
    
    The image should not appear outside the card.
    
    Keep generous spacing and maintain the previous layout where the text was above and the image occupied the lower part of the card.
    
    Everything should feel like one unified Apple-inspired card with 16px border radius.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{%- liquid
  comment
    "apple" stili opsiyoneldir. Varsayilan "klasik", yani bu blogun
    kullanildigi diger sayfalarin ciktisi bit bit ayni kaliyor.
  endcomment
  assign apple = false
  if block.settings.stil == 'apple'
    assign apple = true
  endif
  assign apple_oran = 62.5
  case block.settings.apple_oran
    when 'kare'
      assign apple_oran = 100
    when 'dort_uc'
      assign apple_oran = 75
    when 'onalti_dokuz'
      assign apple_oran = 56.25
  endcase
  assign apple_nokta = block.settings.dot_size | times: 3
-%}

{% style %}
  .ttn-hiw-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.subheading_spacing }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: {%- assign tt_ls = block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.7 -%}{%- if tt_ls >= 28 -%}-1px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 20 -%}-0.8px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 16 -%}-0.3px{%- else -%}normal{%- endif -%};
  }

  .ttn-hiw-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-slider-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
    padding: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.card_gap }}px * 3)) / 4);
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-width: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .ttn-hiw-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: {{ block.settings.badge_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.badge_size }}px;
    padding: 0 {{ block.settings.badge_padding }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.step_number_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin: 0 auto {{ block.settings.step_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: {%- assign tt_ls = block.settings.title_size -%}{%- if tt_ls >= 28 -%}-1px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 20 -%}-0.8px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 16 -%}-0.3px{%- else -%}normal{%- endif -%};
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.title_spacing }}px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.content_spacing }}px;
    opacity: 0.7;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.image_background }};
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 50%;
    height: 50%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.dot_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.dot_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dot_inactive_color }};
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dot_active_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ttn-hiw-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.card_gap }}px * 1)) / 2);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ttn-hiw-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc(100% - 40px);
    }

    .ttn-hiw-desktop-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
    }

    .ttn-hiw-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ttn-hiw-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }
  }

  {%- if apple %}
  /* --- Apple kipi ---------------------------------------------------
     Kart cercevesi, golge ve ic bosluk yok: icerik dogrudan bolum
     zemininde duruyor. Yukseklik kazanci esas olarak gorsel oranindan
     geliyor (1:1 yerine varsayilan 16:10). Tum kurallar .ttn-hiw-apple
     sinifi altinda; sinif yalnizca stil "apple" secilince basiliyor,
     dolayisiyla klasik kip hic etkilenmiyor. */
  .ttn-hiw-apple-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ttn-hiw-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: transparent;
    box-shadow: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  /* Rozet yerine kucuk, harf araligi acilmis gri etiket */
  .ttn-hiw-apple-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ttn-hiw-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    min-width: 0;
    height: auto;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: transparent;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.step_number_size | minus: 2 }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    border-radius: 0;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-apple-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ttn-hiw-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: {%- assign tt_ls = block.settings.title_size -%}{%- if tt_ls >= 28 -%}-1px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 20 -%}-0.8px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 16 -%}-0.3px{%- else -%}normal{%- endif -%};
  }

  .ttn-hiw-apple-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ttn-hiw-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.45;
    opacity: 0.62;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-apple-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ttn-hiw-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding-bottom: {{ apple_oran }}%;
    border-radius: 18px;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-apple-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ttn-hiw-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-apple-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ttn-hiw-pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  /* Etkin nokta hap seklinde uzuyor */
  .ttn-hiw-apple-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ttn-hiw-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-radius: 999px;
    transition: width 0.25s ease, background-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .ttn-hiw-apple-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ttn-hiw-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    width: {{ apple_nokta }}px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ttn-hiw-apple-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ttn-hiw-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.card_gap }}px * 2)) / 3);
    }
  }

  /* Mobilde bir sonraki kart kenardan gorunsun: kaydirilabildigi belli olsun */
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ttn-hiw-apple-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ttn-hiw-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 78%;
    }
  }
  {%- endif %}
{% endstyle %}

<ttn-how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ttn-hiw-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}{% if apple %} ttn-hiw-apple-{{ ai_gen_id }}{% endif %}"{% if apple %} data-oto-nokta{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ttn-hiw-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ttn-hiw-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ttn-hiw-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
        <div class="ttn-hiw-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ttn-hiw-slider-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ttn-hiw-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-slider>
        {% liquid
          assign step_1_number = block.settings.step_1_number
          assign step_1_desktop_image = block.settings.step_1_desktop_image
          assign step_1_mobile_image = block.settings.step_1_mobile_image
          assign step_1_title = block.settings.step_1_title
          assign step_1_text = block.settings.step_1_text

          assign step_2_number = block.settings.step_2_number
          assign step_2_desktop_image = block.settings.step_2_desktop_image
          assign step_2_mobile_image = block.settings.step_2_mobile_image
          assign step_2_title = block.settings.step_2_title
          assign step_2_text = block.settings.step_2_text

          assign step_3_number = block.settings.step_3_number
          assign step_3_desktop_image = block.settings.step_3_desktop_image
          assign step_3_mobile_image = block.settings.step_3_mobile_image
          assign step_3_title = block.settings.step_3_title
          assign step_3_text = block.settings.step_3_text

          assign step_4_number = block.settings.step_4_number
          assign step_4_desktop_image = block.settings.step_4_desktop_image
          assign step_4_mobile_image = block.settings.step_4_mobile_image
          assign step_4_title = block.settings.step_4_title
          assign step_4_text = block.settings.step_4_text
        %}

        <div class="ttn-hiw-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-card="0">
          <div class="ttn-hiw-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_1_number }}</div>

          {% if step_1_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ttn-hiw-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_1_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}

          {% if step_1_text != blank %}
            <div class="ttn-hiw-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_1_text }}</div>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="ttn-hiw-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if step_1_desktop_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ step_1_desktop_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ step_1_desktop_image.alt | escape }}"
                width="800"
                height="800"
                loading="lazy"
                class="ttn-hiw-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-desktop-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ttn-hiw-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-desktop-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if step_1_mobile_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ step_1_mobile_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ step_1_mobile_image.alt | escape }}"
                width="800"
                height="800"
                loading="lazy"
                class="ttn-hiw-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% elsif step_1_desktop_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ step_1_desktop_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ step_1_desktop_image.alt | escape }}"
                width="800"
                height="800"
                loading="lazy"
                class="ttn-hiw-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ttn-hiw-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ttn-hiw-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-card="1">
          <div class="ttn-hiw-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_2_number }}</div>

          {% if step_2_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ttn-hiw-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_2_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}

          {% if step_2_text != blank %}
            <div class="ttn-hiw-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_2_text }}</div>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="ttn-hiw-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if step_2_desktop_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ step_2_desktop_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ step_2_desktop_image.alt | escape }}"
                width="800"
                height="800"
                loading="lazy"
                class="ttn-hiw-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-desktop-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ttn-hiw-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-desktop-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if step_2_mobile_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ step_2_mobile_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ step_2_mobile_image.alt | escape }}"
                width="800"
                height="800"
                loading="lazy"
                class="ttn-hiw-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% elsif step_2_desktop_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ step_2_desktop_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ step_2_desktop_image.alt | escape }}"
                width="800"
                height="800"
                loading="lazy"
                class="ttn-hiw-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ttn-hiw-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ttn-hiw-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-card="2">
          <div class="ttn-hiw-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_3_number }}</div>

          {% if step_3_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ttn-hiw-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_3_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}

          {% if step_3_text != blank %}
            <div class="ttn-hiw-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_3_text }}</div>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="ttn-hiw-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if step_3_desktop_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ step_3_desktop_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ step_3_desktop_image.alt | escape }}"
                width="800"
                height="800"
                loading="lazy"
                class="ttn-hiw-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-desktop-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ttn-hiw-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-desktop-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if step_3_mobile_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ step_3_mobile_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ step_3_mobile_image.alt | escape }}"
                width="800"
                height="800"
                loading="lazy"
                class="ttn-hiw-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% elsif step_3_desktop_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ step_3_desktop_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ step_3_desktop_image.alt | escape }}"
                width="800"
                height="800"
                loading="lazy"
                class="ttn-hiw-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ttn-hiw-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ttn-hiw-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-card="3">
          <div class="ttn-hiw-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_4_number }}</div>

          {% if step_4_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ttn-hiw-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_4_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}

          {% if step_4_text != blank %}
            <div class="ttn-hiw-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_4_text }}</div>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="ttn-hiw-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if step_4_desktop_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ step_4_desktop_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ step_4_desktop_image.alt | escape }}"
                width="800"
                height="800"
                loading="lazy"
                class="ttn-hiw-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-desktop-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ttn-hiw-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-desktop-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if step_4_mobile_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ step_4_mobile_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ step_4_mobile_image.alt | escape }}"
                width="800"
                height="800"
                loading="lazy"
                class="ttn-hiw-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% elsif step_4_desktop_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ step_4_desktop_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ step_4_desktop_image.alt | escape }}"
                width="800"
                height="800"
                loading="lazy"
                class="ttn-hiw-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ttn-hiw-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ttn-hiw-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ttn-hiw-pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-pagination>
        <button
          class="ttn-hiw-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} active"
          data-dot="0"
          aria-label="Go to step 1"
        ></button>
        <button
          class="ttn-hiw-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          data-dot="1"
          aria-label="Go to step 2"
        ></button>
        <button
          class="ttn-hiw-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          data-dot="2"
